      "text": "Provider failure, malformed model output or cancellation → validated error result; no further model work.\nA technically completed workflow can return a business result of blocked, needs_review or partial.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Provider failure, malformed model output or cancellation → validated error result; no further model work.\nA technically completed workflow can return a business result of blocked, needs_review or partial.",
